l":"郑胄及其父子仕宦时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p059a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-p059a-q","source_order":[47,702,"P059a"],"order":8356},{"id":"zhanggu-e-o013","title":"权两却举昭为丞相乃用顾雍","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-c8b51f68d16b6439fb2b","label":"正文","text":"权两却举昭为丞相乃用顾雍","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"曰方今多事职统大者责重非所以优之也、孙邵卒后百僚复举昭、曰孤岂为子布有爱乎顾丞相事烦而此公性刚所言不从怨咎将兴非所以益之也、乃用顾雍","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0037","role":"卒","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0045","role":"被用为丞相","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"众议两归之人","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec","source_order":[52,27,0],"order":9250}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0037","name":"孙邵","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p033","zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec","zhanggu-q-534673e05839e719c55f"],"facts":[{"id":"wuzhu-f0015","label":"字","text":"长绪","evidence":["wuzhu-f0015-q"]},{"id":"wuzhu-f0016","label":"籍贯","text":"北海","evidence":["wuzhu-f0016-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"长绪","evidence":["wuzhu-f0015-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wuzhu-m-p033-wuzhu-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p033"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o068-wuzhu-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o068"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p043-wuzhu-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p043"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p059-wuzhu-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p059"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-p034-wuzhu-p0037","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-p034"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o068a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6363a8960241c0d42a9f","layer":"original","quote":"四年夏五月〖11〗，丞相孙邵卒。﹝六﹞六月，以太常顾雍为丞相〖12〗。﹝七﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p043a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"邵字长绪。北海人。长八尺。为孔融功曹，融称曰：‘廊庙才也！’从刘繇于江东。及权统事，数陈便宜；以为应纳贡聘，权即从之。拜庐江太守，迁车骑长史。黄武初，为丞相，威远将军，封阳羡侯。","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":10,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p043b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"张温、暨艳奏其事，邵辞位请罪；权释令复职。年六十三卒。","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":99,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p059a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2fcac46deecf90721482","layer":"pei","quote":"父札，才学博达。权为骠骑将军，以札为从事中郎。与张昭、孙邵，共定朝仪。","attribution":"《文士传》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-436f44c3434f84aa19b6","start":20,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-f0015-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"邵字长绪","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":10,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-f0016-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"北海人","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":15,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6363a8960241c0d42a9f","layer":"original","quote":"四年夏五月〖11〗，丞相孙邵卒。﹝六﹞六月，以太常顾雍为丞相〖12〗。﹝七﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p033","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f8fc65649c48680ed05c","layer":"pei","quote":"又曰：‘昔君之来，欲令遣子入侍；于时倾心，欢以承命；徒以登年幼，欲假年岁之间耳。而赤情未蒙昭信，遂见讨责，常用惭怖。自顷国恩，复加开导；忘其前愆，取其后效：喜得因此，寻竟本誓。前已有表具说遣子之意，想君假还，已知之也。’又曰：‘今子当入侍，而未有妃耦；昔君念之，以为可上连缀宗室若夏侯氏；虽中间自弃，常奉戢在心。当垂宿念，为之先后；使获攀龙附骥，永自固定：其为分惠，岂有量哉！如是，欲遣孙长绪与小儿俱入，奉行礼聘，成之在君。’又曰：‘小儿年弱，加教训不足；念当与别，为之缅然！父子恩情，岂有已邪！又欲遣张子布追辅护之。孤性无余，凡所欲为，今尽宣露。惟恐赤心不（先）〔克〕畅达，是以具为君说之，宜明所以。’","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43467797fb37569f4074","start":0,"end":302,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-c83aa5cd5e3564bc77d6","layer":"pei","quote":"于是诏曰：‘权前对浩周自陈，不敢自远，乐委质长为外臣；又前后辞旨，头尾击地：此鼠子自知不能保尔许地也。又今与周书，请以十二月遣子；复欲遣孙长绪、张子布随子俱来，彼二人皆权股肱心腹也。又欲为子于京师求妇，此权〔无〕异心之明效也。’帝既信权甘言，且谓周为得其真；而权但华伪，竟无遣子意。自是之后，帝既彰权罪；周亦见疏远，终身不用。”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43467797fb37569f4074","start":0,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p043","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"邵字长绪。北海人。长八尺。为孔融功曹，融称曰：‘廊庙才也！’从刘繇于江东。及权统事，数陈便宜；以为应纳贡聘，权即从之。拜庐江太守，迁车骑长史。黄武初，为丞相，威远将军，封阳羡侯。张温、暨艳奏其事，邵辞位请罪；权释令复职。年六十三卒。","attribution":"《吴录》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":10,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p043-judgment","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-6b2bb5d40ee64209cfad","layer":"pei","quote":"《志林》曰：“吴之创基，邵为首相；史无其传，窃常怪之。尝问刘声叔。声叔，博物君子也，云：‘推其名位，自应立传。项竣、（吴）〔丁〕孚时，已有注记此，云“与张惠恕不能”。后韦氏作史，盖惠恕之党，故不见书。’","attribution":"《志林》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":384,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ca3da22a7824a5fd1e57","start":127,"end":228,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-p059","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-2fcac46deecf90721482","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《文士传》曰：“胄字敬先，沛国人。父札，才学博达。权为骠骑将军，以札为从事中郎。与张昭、孙邵，共定朝仪。胄，其少子，有文武姿局，少知名。举贤良，稍迁建安太守。吕壹宾客于郡犯法，胄收付狱，考竟。壹怀恨，后密谮胄。权大怒，召胄还。潘濬、陈表并为请，得释。后拜宣信校尉，往救公孙渊；已为魏所破，还，迁执金吾。子丰，字曼季。有文学操行，与陆云善，与云诗（词）〔相〕往反。司空张华辟，未就，卒。”","attribution":"《文士传》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-436f44c3434f84aa19b6","start":0,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-0ec39c5c47690bc63dec","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0129010915a6b23b91c3","layer":"original","quote":"初，权当置丞相，众议归昭。权曰：“方今多事，职统大者责重：非所以优之也〖13〗。”后孙邵卒〖14〗，百僚复举昭。权曰：“孤岂为子布有爱乎？（领）〔顾〕丞相事烦〖15〗，而此公性刚；所言不从，怨咎将兴：非所以益之也！”乃用顾雍","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-534673e05839e719c55f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-2cf0929ef24b445f39d3","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，改为太常，进封醴陵侯。代孙邵为丞相，平尚书事","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-28bd067e0a3e898385bc","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗三年：建兴三年（公元 225）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d52302c7e46aff00f085","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o023","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-862592827af5abe9feb3","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖10〗，亮率众南征〖11〗。﹝三﹞其秋，悉平：军资所出〖12〗，国以富饶；﹝四﹞乃治戎讲武，以俟大举。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
